    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The spice balance matters here -- too much and the buns taste muddy, too little and they are just sweet rolls. The honey glaze goes on the moment they come out of the oven, while they are still piping hot. It gives them the characteristic sticky, glossy finish."
          }
        ]
